# Wooldridge Textbook References

## File Structure

Textbook is in `docs/wooldridge/` as page-range files:
- `pages_1-10.md`, `pages_11-20.md`, ..., `pages_731-741.md`
- Each file is ~29KB (10 pages, ~7,500 tokens)
- Total: 73 files covering 741 pages
- Page markers `{123}---` preserved for citations

## At Analysis Start

**Load relevant page-range files into context based on the topic.**

Example: For fixed effects analysis, read:
- `docs/wooldridge/pages_271-280.md` (Ch 10.4: Random effects)
- `docs/wooldridge/pages_281-290.md` (Ch 10.5: Fixed effects)
- `docs/wooldridge/pages_291-300.md` (Ch 10.5-10.6: FE policy analysis)
- `docs/wooldridge/pages_301-310.md` (Ch 10.7: Hausman test)

